# MME-0114: the live visual-gate report is regenerated on every `npm run visual` run.
# Committing it guarantees the file in git describes whichever partial run happened last;
# the summary that matters is recorded in docs/internal/build-log.md, and CI uploads the
# JSON as a build artifact.
docs/internal/visual-checks/visual-gate-report.json
